# Line endings: keep everything LF in the repository and the working copy.
# The deploy target is Linux, and a CRLF shell script or systemd unit can fail at
# runtime ("bad interpreter", "missing ]"). CRLF in a checkout also made every
# host-versus-repo diff unreadable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must stay untouched.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.db binary
